# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid leaking local secrets/build
# artifacts into the image (the Dockerfile rebuilds everything with `turbo
# prune` + `turbo build` from source anyway).
#
# IMPORTANT: do not exclude any apps/* or packages/* workspace member here —
# `turbo prune` / `pnpm install` need the full, accurate workspace graph
# (pnpm-workspace.yaml + pnpm-lock.yaml reference every package) even though
# only @family-app/api's subset ends up in the final pruned output.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
architecture-map.html
backups
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
